# StoryMotion AI - Strict Zero-Cost Local Configuration
# Absolutely no paid APIs, no subscriptions, no cloud fees.

# Local WAN 2.1 Video Inference Server (Runs locally on your Windows 11 PC with your NVIDIA GPU)
# Start with: scripts\run_local_wan.bat
WAN_ENGINE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
WAN_MODEL=wan-2.1-t2v-1.4b

# Optional: Gemini API key for story director (Free tier available)
# If left empty, the built-in local smart director generates stories 100% offline for free.
GEMINI_API_KEY=